# Separate recheck before done

Nothing counts as done until a separate agent that did not build the change rechecks it against the real code, data, and tests.

- Do not use a fast model for that recheck.
- The agent posts PASS or FAIL with evidence as a comment on the draft pull request.
- The author's own test run is not that comment.
- Leave the pull request as a draft. Boss merges.

This rule is recorded in `docs/knowledge/rules.md`.
